            </note>
            <note corresp="#d90-f2" n="2" xml:id="d90-f2-content">
                <p>The enclosure is not printed. On the source text, Eisenhower wrote: “approved,
                    DE.” The statement, issued on September 26, is printed in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Public Papers of the Presidents of the United States:
                        Dwight D. Eisenhower, 1956</hi>, p. 805.</p>
            </note>
